From 1cee3c0a23677dad857d623d3f9c25d49f48d9f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aribe <aribe@opensquad.local>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 14:29:48 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(evolution): suporte a EvoAPI v2 com instance no path e
 parsing de resposta v2

Quando options.instance e fornecido, o adapter usa endpoints v2: /message/sendText/instance em vez de /send/text. Parsing de status e message ID compativel com ambos os formatos v1 e v2. Backward compatible sem instance.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
---
 src/adapters/evolution/index.ts | 96 ++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 71 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/adapters/evolution/index.ts b/src/adapters/evolution/index.ts
index 494b94d..d670e58 100644
